#: ../../get_start/corr_3pcf/corr_3pcf.rst:112
msgid "Data, randoms, and products"
msgstr ""

#: ../../get_start/corr_3pcf/corr_3pcf.rst:114
msgid ""
"``sfc_field`` supplies a shared data field; ``sfc_field1`` through "
"``sfc_field3`` override individual vertices. The random inputs follow the"
" same pattern. ``random: uniform`` uses the analytic constant-density "
"shortcut, whereas a path or ``SFCField`` represents an explicit random "
"catalogue."
msgstr ""

